Reason: the First Person mod's weapons (FLUDD held in view, or on his back in third person; api->held_fludd): their own models are drawn in FLUDD's place while one is chosen (ext/modapi/game/modapi_weapon_models.cpp). As FLUDD is entered for drawing, the weapon's packet is entered too and FLUDD (held in view) or only its nozzle (on his back) left out. Without the mod showing one, nothing changes.

